13:["$","$L17",null,{"title":"热播电影","keyName":"dianying","videos":["$8:props:children:0:props:bannerList:0","$8:props:children:0:props:bannerList:1","$8:props:children:0:props:bannerList:2","$8:props:children:0:props:bannerList:3","$8:props:children:0:props:bannerList:4","$8:props:children:0:props:bannerList:5",{"id":"f70bc0405420580df6011bf312c522a4","title":"山竹刀","type":"dianying","typeName":"动作片","pic":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260906-1/c782d313aa4c8fcfd84cd0a04ac148f8.webp","lang":"汉语普通话","area":"中国大陆","year":"2026","note":"正片","actor":"","director":"靳苏杭","des":"<p>《山竹刀》改编自第22届中国动漫金龙奖获奖作品。 女侠芷竹与医女李小若因缘同行，一场看似简单的还刀之旅，将二人卷入接踵而至的江湖风波。一路上，她们面对追逐、选择与未知，也在彼此陪伴中重新理解侠义与守护。 影片融合江南风情、地域文化与传统武侠美学，以独特的东方视觉呈现一个关于江湖、情义与归途的武侠故事。</p>","last":"2026-09-06 18:39:32","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"正片","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260906/h964mlgf/index.m3u8"}]}]},{"id":"b44e3a5b92fb4dfb1d90f8507bdf515d","title":"求救信号2026","type":"dianying","typeName":"动作片","pic":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260904-1/1fce922391d1e3d82741a5e4d2d0f3af.webp","lang":"英语","area":"美国","year":"2026","note":"正片","actor":"瑞安·雷诺兹 / 肯尼思·布拉纳 / 玛丽亚·巴卡洛娃 / 温迪·古逊 / 路易斯·坎瑟米 / 克拉克·约翰森 / 小亚历克斯·马里亚里 / 马辛·多洛辛斯基 / 亚历克斯·奥泽罗夫 / 克里斯蒂安· 杰达 / 洛弗尔·亚当斯-格雷 / 唐纳德·沙利斯 / 亚瑟·霍尔顿 / Art Kulik / 帕特里克·克尔顿 / Fernando Becerra / Erniel Baez / 亚历山大·德罗任 / Joey Coleman / 洛里·奥多姆","director":"约翰·弗朗西斯·戴利 / 乔纳森·戈尔茨坦","des":"<p>　在冷战高峰期，自视甚高的美国海军飞行员Troy &#39;Assassin&#39; Kelly上尉飞到苏联去执行秘密任务，然而任务崩了，他一个人被困在敌后方，被性情暴躁、喜好美国文化的前克格勃特工Nikolai Ustinov发现。Troy以为自己完了，但是他们之间出人意料的结盟，是否会让Troy获救，以及发展出一段双方都没想到的情谊？</p>","last":"2026-09-04 12:48:34","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"正片","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260904/DX7jOr6z/index.m3u8"}]},{"sourceName":"量子资源 (liangzi)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"liangzi","links":[{"name":"HD中字","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/0c89807ba823331f1ad1f93fd7859f92"}]},{"sourceName":"量子资源 (lzm3u8)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"lzm3u8","links":[{"name":"HD中字","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260904/16470_3f401417/index.m3u8"}]}]},{"id":"51cf99918abee32813ffd9faf21b1a58","title":"逃亡者","type":"dianying","typeName":"动作片","pic":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260902-1/63c067d5e75c05cc963e8347ea551609.webp","lang":"英语","area":"英国","year":"2026","note":"正片","actor":"盖尔·加朵 / 戴米恩·路易斯 / 皮埃尔·伯格曼 / 黄米莉 / Stevie Binns / Ruby Valentino / 肯顿·劳埃德·摩根 / 蒂利亚纳·布克丽瓦 / Aaron Gill / Caroline Glass / Christopher Moore / 杰西卡·惠心·汤 / Ross Forder / 罗伯特·史密斯 / 埃尔德·费尔南德斯 / Sara Willats","director":"凯文·麦克唐纳","des":"<p>　Gadot plays a high-powered attorney who must race through London, following the cryptic commands of a mysterious Caller, as she fights against time to save her abducted son.</p>","last":"2026-09-02 18:57:45","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"正片","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260902/DHOOUr5J/index.m3u8"}]}]},{"id":"2e0a77d368d293d00d48bb712ed873e7","title":"鲨笼绝境","type":"dianying","typeName":"动作片","pic":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260826-1/8765173a58672eba549c7af9b012a257.webp","lang":"英语","area":"西班牙 / 美国","year":"2026","note":"正片","actor":"拉米罗·阿隆索 / 安东尼奥·班德拉斯 / 瑞安·伯特罗奇 / 耶斯·利奥丹 / 迭戈·利纳斯 / 路易·曼迪勒 / 劳拉·马兰洛 / 蒂莫西·V·墨菲 / 克里斯蒂娜·奥乔亚 / 罗德里戈·波伊松 / 马里奥·塔东 / 唐查·泰南","director":"杰西·约翰逊","des":"<p>　五位挚友相约前往热带海岛度假，计划在碧蓝海域中体验刺激的鲨鱼笼潜水，同时享受奢靡的派对狂欢。然而他们浑然不知，这趟旅程不过是一场精心布局的犯罪幌子，幕后主谋正是行事冷酷、算无遗策的危险人物“伯恩斯”——他在暴力中淬炼成型，对大海了如指掌。当阴谋突然引爆，一场激烈冲突 让女主角塔蒂亚娜与好友卡莉被困深海之中：头顶是氧气瓶指针飞速下滑的恐慌，四周是游弋不去的鲨鱼，水面之上则是伯恩斯穷凶极恶的手下虎视眈眈。夹在水下猛兽与水面上暴徒的双重绞杀之间，塔蒂亚娜必须凭借全部的智慧与勇气，在生命流逝之前找到逃出生天、拯救同伴的唯一出路。影片将海洋生存惊悚的窒息感与犯罪动作的高燃节奏融于一体，充满意料之外的反转，令人屏息。</p>","last":"2026-08-26 22:20:43","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"正片","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260826/qYkbRaoR/index.m3u8"}]}]},{"id":"cc8d336a8a74976abd9bd4c68a77b9f9","title":"怒之杀","type":"dianying","typeName":"动作片","pic":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260826-1/67e70bf6dd7e0c0f497db4c990097b16.webp","lang":"英语","area":"英国 / 美国","year":"2026","note":"正片","actor":"杰森·斯坦森 / 安娜贝拉·沃丽丝 / 阿纳斯·费达拉维修斯 / 艾德里安·莱斯特 / 罗兰·默勒 / 钱尼尔·库勒 / 李·查尔斯 / 汤姆·克里斯蒂安 / 杰森·王 / 史蒂文·布拉德斯 / 本·卡特赖特 / 露米·萨顿","director":"让-弗朗索瓦·雷切","des":"<p>　科尔·里德（杰森·斯坦森 饰）是富豪蒂布（阿蒙·蒂卡拉姆 饰）的贴身保镖，但一场意外袭击让蒂布丧命，科尔也被诬陷为凶手，全境通缉。</p><p>　　恩人被杀、自己蒙冤，科尔带着满腔愤怒，只身闯入远洋货轮开启一秒收割一命的硬核复仇，又意外揭开了一个骇人听闻的阴谋……怒火点燃大海，货轮成为血色牢笼，一场避无可避的厮杀即将展开！</p><p><br/></p>","last":"2026-08-26 13:13:03","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"正片","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260826/oKjnFmeL/index.m3u8"}]},{"sourceName":"量子资源 (liangzi)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"liangzi","links":[{"name":"HD中字","url":"https://v.lfthirtytwo.com/share/ebe922af8d4560c73368a88eeac07d16"}]},{"sourceName":"量子资源 (lzm3u8)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"lzm3u8","links":[{"name":"HD中字","url":"https://v.lfthirtytwo.com/20260820/9634_671add2a/index.m3u8"}]}]},{"id":"acb15ef41b49dd57683155abdae47a77","title":"深空法则","type":"dianying","typeName":"动作片","pic":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260821-1/f2232f6ef104c5491949dbd15608793e.webp","lang":"汉语普通话","area":"中国大陆","year":"2026","note":"正片","actor":"高迦澜 / 萧子墨 / 姚俊哲 / 梁斯文 / 张星宇 / 唐前伟 / 吴烨","director":"王人超","des":"<p>　未来世界资源枯竭，人类派出承载最后希望的殖民星舰“昆仑山号”前往宇宙深空，探寻生存之路。漫长未知的航行使得章诚舰长和船员们都渐渐被负面情绪左右，颠覆想象的危机也悄然而至。在深空绝境中，生存成了最高优先级。内忧外患下，他们能否绝处逢生？人类火种，能否达到彼岸？</p>","last":"2026-08-21 18:41:48","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"正片","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260821/HlU0fHGZ/index.m3u8"}]}]}]}]
14:["$","$L17",null,{"title":"热播电视剧","keyName":"dianshi","videos":[{"id":"5e4d2c0c09a0eb4020679b014b5b7d88","title":"我的后半生","type":"dianshi","typeName":"连续剧","pic":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20250330-1/70d2f0aaa28050e07661d0a9b6bc6c0e.jpg","lang":"国语","area":"大陆","year":"2025","note":"已完结","actor":"张国立,佟大为,梅婷,许娣,周野芒,杨童舒,严晓频,丁嘉丽,邬君梅,张丰毅,韩童生,牛飘,齐欢,沈佳妮,王真儿,郑卫莉,梁家桐","director":"董富来,潘戍午","des":"<p>       该剧改编自王蒙的小说《奇葩奇葩处处哀》。                                    </p><p>       沈卓然是已退休的文学系教授，儿女双全、三代同堂，发妻去世后他在老友的鼓励下开启了相亲之旅。他先后遇到了四位相亲对象。善解人意的护士长因房产与他分道扬镳；女科学家癌症复发选择了不告而别；工会主任的强势让他受到心理打压；酷似发妻的对象提出了让他为难的要求。                                    </p><p>       不同的情感经历给 沈卓然带来了新的成长，他对爱和生活的思索也影响着一路陪伴的家人们。</p>","last":"2025-09-21 13:57:35","sources":[{"sourceName":"量子资源 (liangzi)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"liangzi","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/0a0a0c8aaa00ade50f74a3f0ca981ed7"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/2ac2406e835bd49c70469acae337d292"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/97af4fb322bb5c8973ade16764156bed"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/b20bb95ab626d93fd976af958fbc61ba"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/9adeb82fffb5444e81fa0ce8ad8afe7a"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/491442df5f88c6aa018e86dac21d3606"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/f7cade80b7cc92b991cf4d2806d6bd78"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/33ceb07bf4eeb3da587e268d663aba1a"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/6a61d423d02a1c56250dc23ae7ff12f3"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/3a029f04d76d32e79367c4b3255dda4d"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/25df35de87aa441b88f22a6c2a830a17"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/3210ddbeaa16948a702b6049b8d9a202"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/310ce61c90f3a46e340ee8257bc70e93"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.lzcd