4-1/88afa860c56dbb8ec9cb1bdcc0fadf25.webp","lang":"汉语普通话","area":"中国大陆","year":"2026","note":"更新至第12集","actor":"张一山,谭卓,曹磊,杨立新,刘威,于慧,赵亮,六小龄童,杨新鸣,何中华,谭正岩,邢岷山,周九良,张炜迅,张树晨,杨名,杜奕衡,高阳,魏楷峰,刚毅,刘立伟,张喜前,杜玉明","director":"郑大圣","des":"<p>故事讲述了 18 岁出科的孟金福，从武丑到武生再到老生，从前途渺茫的菊坛新人到蜚声京城的梨园名角，一个天赋平平、家境贫寒的普通少年，在时代环境与发展的历程中成长蜕变，最终在竞争残酷的梨园中站稳脚跟，并彪炳史册的江湖传奇。</p>","last":"2026-09-18 11:57:32","sources":[{"sourceName":"量子资源 (liangzi)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"liangzi","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/ea2af5ea4aabdca1d9ded27f252b8e41"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/7a1bc993c84aa757a165fbc2984ae42f"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/d40176e2795b1a99dc59620ac92a54c3"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/98795443cdbf0375dd946728e2f4e51a"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/512844c25cd1c9af079ba08f868eb637"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/9487c0d93b1eb327013934c5b0d17ae4"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/1f49216e5390c53da48b0e5a77a5c48c"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/12f6de45d4efe308cfeeca3f1d0bc3af"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/e4f26beeb0ae24b92ffd355f5e9c5fda"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/7e5c6adb4152e8d402e5dba26664fa32"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/4ddcf81ffc4375a8ebbb7c8fe80896b8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/ac0bfdba5fb1f97273dbcc5039c665c4"}]},{"sourceName":"量子资源 (lzm3u8)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"lzm3u8","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260914/16924_33f3b0bf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260914/16922_87c6d027/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260914/16920_4b7cee2d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/20260914/16921_713a16bc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/202